  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Ge Pi blessed land’s tree land spirit includes Genesis Lotus Immortal Venerable’s fresh blood among the materials required for ownership, after asking for a hundred thousand immortal essence stones and large amounts of immortal materials, including many rank seven and rank eight materials. That final condition is the hardest part of the demand.",
