      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Genesis Lotus Immortal Venerable was a wood path rank nine Gu Venerable, and Yao Ge Pi also cultivated wood path, so his desire for that blood is not strange. Even if Heavenly Lotus Sect preserved the fresh blood, it would be a true rank nine immortal material, precious enough to refine rank nine Immortal Gu and heavily guarded.",
